{"id":"dd20fea9-0a44-410f-8be7-056355a748bb","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:46:39.503Z","batchId":"login_deepseek-v4-1-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\" style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 0 64px;\">\n\n  <div class=\"brand\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    <div style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:11px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f46e5,#0ea5e9);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.02em;\">N</div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Northwind Console</div>\n      <div class=\"small muted\">Workspace sign-in</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Sign in to your account</h2>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Use the work email your workspace admin invited. Sessions are encrypted end to end.</p>\n\n    <form id=\"login-form\" novalidate style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;\">\n      <label>\n        Email address\n        <input id=\"email\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"username\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" required>\n      </label>\n\n      <label>\n        Password\n        <span class=\"password-field\" style=\"position:relative;display:block;\">\n          <input id=\"password\" type=\"password\" name=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" placeholder=\"Enter your password\" required style=\"padding-right:74px;\">\n          <button type=\"button\" id=\"toggle-password\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" style=\"position:absolute;right:4px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);\" aria-label=\"Show password\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Show</button>\n        </span>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"remember\" checked>\n          Remember me\n        </label>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" style=\"font-weight:550;\">Forgot password?</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <button id=\"submit-btn\" type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Sign in</button>\n\n      <div id=\"form-error\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"display:none;\" role=\"alert\"></div>\n    </form>\n\n    <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin:16px 0 0;\">Remember me keeps you signed in on this browser for 30 days. Don't use it on a shared device.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:20px;\">\n    Don't have an account? <a href=\"#\">Request access</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"#\">Contact support</a>\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:8px;\">Protected by SSO-ready 2FA · Session ID not shared</p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var pwd = document.getElementById('password');\n    var toggle = document.getElementById('toggle-password');\n    var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n    var email = document.getElementById('email');\n    var btn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n    var err = document.getElementById('form-error');\n\n    toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var show = pwd.type === 'password';\n      pwd.type = show ? 'text' : 'password';\n      toggle.textContent = show ? 'Hide' : 'Show';\n      toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(show));\n      toggle.setAttribute('aria-label', show ? 'Hide password' : 'Show password');\n      pwd.focus();\n    });\n\n    function showError(msg) {\n      err.textContent = msg;\n      err.style.display = 'block';\n    }\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      err.style.display = 'none';\n\n      if (!email.value.trim() || email.value.indexOf('@') < 1) {\n        showError('Enter a valid email address to continue.');\n        email.focus();\n        return;\n      }\n      if (!pwd.value) {\n        showError('Enter your password to continue.');\n        pwd.focus();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      btn.disabled = true;\n      btn.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n      setTimeout(function () {\n        btn.disabled = false;\n        btn.textContent = 'Sign in';\n        showError('We could not verify these credentials. Check your password or reset it below.');\n      }, 900);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[5889,"<div"],[5889," class"],[5889,"=\""],[5889,"page"],[5889,"\""],[5901," style"],[5911,"=\""],[5911,"max"],[5911,"-width"],[5911,":"],[5911,"420"],[5926,"px"],[5926,";"],[5926,"margin"],[5932,":"],[5942,"0"],[5942," auto"],[5942,";"],[5942,"padding"],[5954,":"],[5962,"48"],[5962,"px"],[5962," "],[5962,"0"],[5983," "],[5996,"64"],[6174,"px"],[6187,";"],[6187,"\">\n\n"],[6187," "],[6187," <"],[6187,"div"],[6187," class"],[6187,"=\""],[6187,"brand"],[6187,"\""],[6187," style"],[6187,"=\""],[6187,"display"],[6187,":"],[6187,"flex"],[6187,";"],[6187,"align"],[6187,"-items"],[6187,":"],[6187,"center"],[6187,";"],[6187,"gap"],[6187,":"],[6187,"10"],[6187,"px"],[6187,";"],[6187,"margin"],[6187,"-bottom"],[6187,":"],[6187,"28"],[6187,"px"],[6187,";\">\n"],[6187,"   "],[6187," <"],[6187,"div"],[6187," style"],[6187,"=\""],[6187,"width"],[6187,":"],[6187,"38"],[6187,"px"],[6187,";"],[6187,"height"],[6187,":"],[6187,"38"],[6187